repository-code: 'https://github.com/nasa/AppEEARS-QGIS-Plugin'
abstract: >-
  This repository contains the AppEEARS-QGIS-Plugin. It allows
  users to load cloud-optimized geotiffs directly into QGIS
  from previously submitted Area Sample Requests made to NASA's
  Application for Extracting and Exploring Analysis Ready
  Samples (AppEEARS).
